Package: mysql-replicator
Version: @VERSION@
Section: database
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: adduser
Maintainer: DMS DBA <dms-dba@gannett.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/GannettDigital/mysql-replicator
Description: MySQL 8.4 to 5.7 replication
 Direct MySQL replication service that reads MySQL binary logs (MySQL 8.4)
 and applies changes to a target database (MySQL 5.7) across incompatible
 versions and dialects.
